00:22:29.300 --> 00:22:31.947
So like the guy in Plato's
Allegory of the Cave,

00:22:31.947 --> 00:22:35.070
for us to leave the cave to find truth,

00:22:35.070 --> 00:22:36.960
Burnham needs to leave his guesthouse

00:22:36.960 --> 00:22:41.200
